      "writtenOn": "2026-10-14T22:59:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`FixedDiv(src_height, src_height)` is equal to `1 \u003c\u003c 16`, right?\n\nShould we replace this line with the following?\n\n```\n      dy \u003d 1 \u003c\u003c 16;  // 1 as 16.16 fixed point\n```\n\nor\n\n```\n      dy \u003d 1 \u003c\u003c 16;  // FixedDiv(src_height, src_height)\n```",
      "revId": "8dabf898eeee2e08d41666ee24533da35f4dcee7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
